	(text "GPADC is can be used to measure analog voltages up to 1.8V.\nIf you want to measure a voltage greater than this, use a\nvoltage divider as shown. Choose values for R1 and R2 such\nthat V_ADC never exceeds 1.8V for the maximum V_MEASURE\n\nV_ADC = V_MEASURE * R9 / (R8 + R9)"
